  "question": {
    "text": "<div>\r<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:black\">A ray of light is incident normally on one of the faces of a prism of apex angle&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;and refractive index&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> <mo>.</mo> </mrow> </math> </span><span>&nbsp;The angle of deviation of the ray is</span></p>\r</div>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<div><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math>  <mrow>   <mn>30</mn><mo>&deg;</mo>  </mrow> </math>  </span></p></div>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<div><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math>  <mrow>   <mn>45</mn><mo>&deg;</mo>  </mrow> </math>  </span></p></div>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<div><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mn>15</mn><mo>°</mo> </mrow> </math> </span></p></div>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "none of these",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><span>Using Snell’s law for the refraction at AC, we get</span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mi>sini</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>sinr</mi></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>sinr</mi></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sinr</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>     </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math> <mo>∴</mo> </math> </span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Angle of deviation &nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>°</mo><mo>.</mo> </mrow> </math> </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0022_a7d70f935bb1.jpeg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 177px;\" /></p>"
  }
}